Package: rutomq
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: SamuelSupe <SamuelSupe@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, systemd
Homepage: https://samuelsupe.github.io/rutomq/
Description: Stateless Kafka-compatible message queue
 rutomq is a Rust message queue that writes durable records directly to
 S3-compatible object storage and keeps ordered metadata in PostgreSQL. Agents
 require no local WAL or persistent volume.
